{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/267561-suggest-to-me-strategy-themed-endowments","id":267561,"title":"Suggest to me: Strategy themed Endowments","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-28T12:13:26-07:00","id":267561,"title":"Suggest to me: Strategy themed Endowments","content":"So I have a question for everyone, I'm fishing for ideas for &quot;strategy themed&quot; endowments, I'm looking for one per compact. Now what I mean by strategy themed is a combination of two traits:<br /> <br /> 1) It's used before the battle starts, to prepare for battle.<br /> 2) It works on a relatively large scale.<br /> <br /> As an example: <br /> <br /> <b>St Joan's Glory</b><br /> <br /> Religion leads people, in peace and in war. When ordinary people encounter the supernatural they often turn to religion for guidance and comfort. The Shadow Congregation delivers. In the name of St Joan of Arc they lead people to war. What might have been a mob of peasants becomes a disciplined and well trained army.<br /> To invoke St Joan the hunter must make a rousing speech. The effects of the Endowment apply in full to every mortal who can hear the Hunter's voice. Technology or magic cannot be used to project the hunter's voice.<br /> <b>Cost:</b> 1 Willpower Dot<br /> <b>Action:</b> Instant, at least five minuets of speaking.<br /> <b>Dice Pool:</b> Presence + Benediction<br /> <b>Roll Results</b><br /> <b>Dramatic Failure:</b> The crowd turn upon the hunter, burnings at the stake are surprisingly common.<br /> <b>Failure:</b> Nothing happens.<br /> <b>Success:</b> Every mortal who hears the hunter's words and may apply Successes as extra dots to Brawl, Firearms, Weaponry or Resistance for a day, but no trait can be increased past five. Resistance duplicates the Supernatural Tolerance effects of Potency. If you use it, St Joan's Glory will suppress the Unblooded Condition. Multiple invocations of St Joan's Glory will not stack.<br /> <b>Exceptional Success:</b> Extra Successes are their own reward.<br /> <b>Suggested Modifiers: </b>The hunter is a woman (+1). The hunter is preaching to their own congregation (+1). The hunter is preaching to predominately military personal (+2). Performed on May 30, Feast day of St. Joan of Arc (+5).<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}